# Every byte the browser executes, pinned.
#
# `make pyodide` and `make typst` download a Python interpreter and a
# typesetter that then run in the reader's browser. Nothing here is built
# from source, and one of the sources is a mutable git branch, so the
# download is only as trustworthy as this file: scripts/fetch.sh refuses
# to install anything whose SHA-256 is not listed below, and re-running
# either target re-verifies what is already on disk.
#
# To move a version: bump it in the Makefile, delete the affected files,
# fetch them, and record the new hashes here deliberately.

